I didn't think you'd be awake.


00:02:28.332 --> 00:02:29.492
You have an appointment...


00:02:29.667 --> 00:02:32.261
...with Guy Morgan,
I didn't think you'd wanna be late.


00:02:32.436 --> 00:02:35.371
Oh, look at you thinking. Cute.


00:02:35.539 --> 00:02:37.598
But I always have time for my portrait.


00:02:37.775 --> 00:02:39.299
Look alive. Paint.


00:02:39.743 --> 00:02:41.574
I'm feeling spiritually blocked.


00:02:41.745 --> 00:02:43.576
