Guy Morgan.


00:07:00.938 --> 00:07:02.769
Could you give his son, Luke, a tour?


00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:05.807
Sure. Would you like
to see the Wellesley perks?


00:07:05.976 --> 00:07:08.604
Um, yes, brilliant. Sure.


00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:11.070
