00:08:00.797 --> 00:08:04.426
Oh, do you want this?


00:08:09.239 --> 00:08:12.504
She shoots, she scores.
Unlike you, soccer boy.


00:08:14.845 --> 00:08:18.576
Oh, so spill it. Is Luke Morgan
as hot as everyone Tweets he is?


00:08:18.749 --> 00:08:20.114
Hotter.


00:08:20.284 --> 00:08:21.911
You should ask him to the dance.


00:08:22.085 --> 00:08:24.315
Because I'm so forward with guys.


00:08:24.488 --> 00:08:27.048
First time for everything, right?


00:08:34.198 --> 00:08:35.893
- Hi, Luke.
- Hello.


00:08:36.066 --> 00:08:37.294
