is mad, mad drama, okay?


00:09:56.446 --> 00:09:58.846
I am talking to you
and you don't even know my name.


00:09:59.016 --> 00:10:00.916
- I'm Mickey O'Malley.
- Mickey O'Malley.


00:10:01.084 --> 00:10:02.711
A rarity in the Irish community.


00:10:03.287 --> 00:10:05.380
Om.


00:10:06.189 --> 00:10:08.817
RAVl: Om.
- Om.


00:10:08.992 --> 00:10:11.085
- Om.
- Om!


00:10:11.261 --> 00:10:13.786
This is not a contest, Ms. Gail.


00:10:14.164 --> 00:10:15.791
Just concentrate on your breathing.


00:10:17.301 --> 00:10:18.461
My butt is numb.


00:10:18.802 --> 00:10:21.999
If your butt is suffering,
then you are suffering.


00:10:22.172 --> 00:10:25.630
In fact, your entire life is suffering. Why?


00:10:25.809 --> 00:10:28.903
Because you crave
that which is meaningless.


00:10:29.079 --> 00:10:31.070
Are you calling me shallow?


00:10:32.149 --> 00:10:37.985
No, I'm saying to stop your craving
and release your butt.


00:10:38.155 --> 00:10:41.716
Just release it. Release it, yeah.
Release that butt.


00:10:42.592 --> 00:10:45.652
<i>Release that butt
Oh, yeah, release that butt</i>


00:10:45.829 --> 00:10:48.423
<i>Oh, yeah, release that butt</i>


00:10:48.598 --> 00:10:49.895
Mrs. Van Ravensway?


00:10:50.067 --> 00:10:52.592
What part
