00:11:55.465 --> 00:11:56.489
<i>Ow.</i>


00:11:56.666 --> 00:11:59.100
<i>What are you doing?
I'm on the phone.</i>


00:11:59.269 --> 00:12:00.861
<i>- I'm cleansing.
Heh, heh.</i>


00:12:01.071 --> 00:12:03.301
Mac and cheese.


00:12:04.207 --> 00:12:07.335
<i>I don't need your spiritual counseling.</i>


00:12:07.878 --> 00:12:09.436
<i>I'm thinking of firing you.</i>


00:12:14.951 --> 00:12:18.318
Pace yourself, Ms. Gail,
