00:12:28.865 --> 00:12:31.857
Did I ever tell you all about the time
I nearly got my big break?


00:12:32.035 --> 00:12:33.525
Yes.
- Good.


00:12:33.703 --> 00:12:35.136
Then you all know how it goes.


00:12:35.572 --> 00:12:37.767
<i>I ain't gonna leap, I'm gonna jump</i>


00:12:37.941 --> 00:12:40.273
<i>Find my way right out of this dump</i>


00:12:43.113 --> 00:12:45.980
- I had talent, and they made me...
A laughingstock.


00:12:47.751 --> 00:12:49.048
Now look at me.


00:12:49.219 --> 00:12:51.710
I got two ungrateful kids...


00:12:51.888 --> 00:12:54.880
