I hate you.


01:05:35.867 --> 01:05:38.131
Very good. You look pretty.


01:05:38.303 --> 01:05:39.998
I know.


01:05:41.673 --> 01:05:44.506
That broad
ain't getting away with ruining your life.


01:05:44.676 --> 01:05:46.337
I'm pooping in her bed tonight.


01:05:46.511 --> 01:05:49.344
Victor, I thought you hated me.


01:05:49.514 --> 01:05:50.606
Are you an idiot?


01:05:50.782 --> 01:05:52.943
You're the only person
who knows my birthday.


01:05:53.117 --> 01:05:54.982
The only one who says goodnight
to me.


01:05:55.153 --> 01:05:57.553
The only one who makes me
mac and cheese.


01:05:57.722 --> 01:05:59.917
You're annoying and ugly...


01:06:00.091 --> 01:06:01.490
...but I sort of love you.


01:06:03.928 --> 01:06:05.555
I sort of love you too.


01:06:06.164 --> 01:06:10.624
But just promise me
you're not gonna do anything, okay?


01:06:11.102 --> 01:06:12.694
- You too.
- Oh, come on.


01:06:12.870 --> 01:06:14.804
- Just... No... Ple...
- Just... No. Just...


01:06:14.972 --> 01:06:16.462
- No. Tony.
- Just one...


01:06:17.375 --> 01:06:18.706
Okay.


01:06:18.976 --> 01:06:23.379
All right.
Well, now I get to go fold Bev's delicates.


01:06:38.896 --> 01:06:42.525
- Have you heard of knocking?
- Ever heard of I don't care?


01:06:42.800 --> 01:06:44.961
Where'd you put my blue blouse?


01:06:45.136 --> 01:06:47.229
Oh, okay.


01:06:47.405 --> 01:06:49.930
Okay, which one of these
do you like better?


01:06:50.842 --> 01:06:54.744
- You actually want my opinion?
- God, I know. What's wrong with me?


01:06:55.713 --> 01:06:59.615
You know how you're a bitch and I act
like I don't care, but truth is I'm sensitive?


01:06:59.784 --> 01:07:02.309
- Actually...
- I need someone to talk to like a sister...


01:07:02.487 --> 01:07:04.387
...and you're better than nothing.


01:07:05.857 --> 01:07:10.294
I'm nervous about tonight.
Oh, my God, why did I just tell you that?


01:07:12.163 --> 01:07:14.256
I don't know.


01:07:14.599 --> 01:07:16.863
It's like my whole body is freaking out.


01:07:17.034 --> 01:07:18.126
I have hives on my butt.


01:07:18.302 --> 01:07:20.770
I can't tell Mom
and I can't talk to Luke about it.


01:07:20.938 --> 01:07:22.303
He'll say something like:


01:07:22.473 --> 01:07:25.408
"Oh, one minute
you're talented and we're connecting...


01:07:25.576 --> 01:07:28.807
...and the next minute you're self-involved
and histrionic."


01:07:28.980 --> 01:07:32.211
- What does that even mean? I hate history.
- He said that?


01:07:34.051 --> 01:07:37.919
Listen, Toadie, he's not falling for you,
he's falling for me.


01:07:38.089 --> 01:07:39.784
I just don't know who me is anymore.


01:07:39.957 --> 01:07:42.255
Why are you nervous?
You're not really singing.


01:07:42.427 --> 01:07:45.487
All you have to do is stand there
and look pretty.


01:07:47.064 --> 01:07:49.897
Have you ever thought
about how that makes me feel?


01:07:50.701 --> 01:07:52.168
You have talent.


01:07:52.336 --> 01:07:55.828
<i>You could go on American Idol
and forget about the rest of us.</i>


01:07:56.073 --> 01:07:58.405
This is, like, my only chance.


01:07:59.110 --> 01:08:00.839
Pretty doesn't last very long.


01:08:01.012 --> 01:08:02.946
Just look at Mom.


01:08:05.116 --> 01:08:06.242
You think I'm talented?


01:08:08.052 --> 01:08:10.145
If you tell anyone I said that, I'll deny it.


01:08:11.856 --> 01:08:13.380
Wear the blue blouse.


01:08:13.558 --> 01:08:15.526
It makes your eyes pop.


01:08:18.629 --> 01:08:19.857
This better work.


01:08:20.431 --> 01:08:22.661
Because if I go down,
you're go down with me.


01:08:35.646 --> 01:08:39.309
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
What's up, my party people?


01:08:39.484 --> 01:08:42.578
Yeah. All right, all right, all right.
Let's get this show started.


01:08:42.753 --> 01:08:46.746
Welcome to the stage, my boy, my British
biscuit and y'all's host for the night...


01:08:46.924 --> 01:08:49.415
...Luke Morgan.


01:08:51.996 --> 01:08:54.988
Are you amped for the Wellesley Academy
of the Arts Showcase?


01:08:56.534 --> 01:09:00.630
Good. Because we have Mickey O'Malley
spinning tonight.


01:09:04.575 --> 01:09:10.639
So let's get this party started
with Big Pain Ticket.


01:09:20.391 --> 01:09:24.157
<i>I wanna kiss your apocalypse</i>


01:09:24.328 --> 01:09:27.422
<i>Wrap you in my Armageddon</i>


01:09:27.598 --> 01:09:31.090
<i>Sing you a twisted serenade</i>


01:09:31.269 --> 01:09:34.329
<i>We can run away together</i>


01:09:44.515 --> 01:09:47.245
Hello, Guy. So glad you could make it.


01:09:47.418 --> 01:09:50.444
My two A&R guys, Tom and, uh, Tom.


01:09:51.022 --> 01:09:52.387
Uh, did I miss your big line up?


01:09:52.557 --> 01:09:56.152
You're just in time. And I know
you'll love the closing act. She's amazing.


01:09:56.327 --> 01:09:58.022
Well, I expect nothing less.


01:09:58.195 --> 01:10:03.428
Oh, yeah. Nothing and less are definitely
