01:10:14.145 --> 01:10:16.204
What a lovely suit.


01:10:20.785 --> 01:10:21.877
Move it.


01:10:22.053 --> 01:10:24.453
Hey. Out of the way. Out of the way.
Michael, go on.


01:10:24.622 --> 01:10:26.886
