- No. No.


01:10:56.220 --> 01:10:59.087
No? No? No? Then focus!


01:11:04.595 --> 01:11:07.257
- Look, Ange, you...
- Gail's been threatening me too.


01:11:07.431 --> 01:11:09.456
That's why you're doing
what she wants.


01:11:09.800 --> 01:11:12.098
