- Ange.


01:11:12.703 --> 01:11:14.637
You're my best friend.


01:11:14.805 --> 01:11:17.239
Look, I'd do anything for you.


01:11:27.718 --> 01:11:29.549
Okay.


01:11:31.789 --> 01:11:36.317
So we're gonna take it up a notch
with Jason Berkeley and the Funky Funk.


01:11:42.166 --> 01:11:43.190
Scratch that.


01:11:43.367 --> 01:11:46.302
Um, here are my boys, the Oral Majority.


01:11:55.012 --> 01:11:57.480
<i>I'm lost in a world that rattles my brain</i>


01:11:57.648 --> 01:12:01.550
<i>Cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:12:04.355 --> 01:12:05.720
Move it. Guy.


01:12:05.890 --> 01:12:10.088
This is just the boring appetizer.
The real showstopper's up next.


01:12:10.261 --> 01:12:11.728
Ah!
Oh!


01:12:11.896 --> 01:12:14.763
You okay, Mr. Morgan?
Here, let me get that for you.


01:12:16.200 --> 01:12:17.394
Well, it had better be.


01:12:17.568 --> 01:12:18.796
I have to pee.


01:12:18.969 --> 01:12:22.200
Oh, I will take you to the pee, Mr. Victor.


01:12:25.142 --> 01:12:26.973
Sorry.


01:12:27.411 --> 01:12:29.936
<i>So keep on knocking, knocking, knocking</i>


01:12:30.114 --> 01:12:35.051
<i>But, baby, you're better off walking
'Cause I ain't gonna let you in</i>


01:12:35.786 --> 01:12:37.947
