01:12:38.122 --> 01:12:41.182
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:41.358 --> 01:12:43.724
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:43.894 --> 01:12:47.227
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:52.036 --> 01:12:53.367
My brothers, yeah!


01:12:53.537 --> 01:12:54.936
Okay.


01:12:55.272 --> 01:12:57.433
You guys having a good time?


01:12:58.008 --> 01:13:02.411
