01:13:22.166 --> 01:13:24.259
<i>The feeling ignites</i>


01:13:24.435 --> 01:13:25.493
<i>I'm in control</i>


01:13:25.669 --> 01:13:29.765
<i>The crowd's in the palm of my hand
All my fans stand</i>


01:13:29.940 --> 01:13:33.376
<i>What is the truth?
What's an illusion?</i>


01:13:33.544 --> 01:13:37.241
<i>You're searching for proof
But are you certain?</i>


01:13:37.414 --> 01:13:40.975
<i>Whatever you see is what you get</i>


01:13:41.152 --> 01:13:44.952
<i>If words paint a picture
Then I bet you I can get you, yeah</i>


01:13:45.122 --> 01:13:49.354
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:13:49.527 --> 01:13:52.758
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:13:52.930 --> 01:13:56.366
