01:13:56.534 --> 01:14:00.231
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:14:00.404 --> 01:14:04.807
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:14:04.975 --> 01:14:06.442
<i>I can be what you want...</i>


01:14:10.314 --> 01:14:11.338
Give me...


01:14:18.022 --> 01:14:22.118
I'm so sorry, my mike...
My mike isn't working.


01:14:22.526 --> 01:14:25.017
Uh, excuse me.


01:14:27.898 --> 01:14:30.025
<i>I don't know.
- Give me that. Give me that.</i>


01:14:35.239 --> 01:14:39.471
How dare you sabotage your mother,
