01:16:33.657 --> 01:16:36.125
<i>Tonight is the night where I make you see</i>


01:16:36.293 --> 01:16:40.195
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:16:40.364 --> 01:16:42.457
<i>You want from me</i>


01:16:48.906 --> 01:16:50.703
That's what I'm talking about.


01:16:52.543 --> 01:16:55.034
Shut the power down. Shut it down.


01:16:58.182 --> 01:17:00.582
Not so fast, jerknuts.


01:17:03.887 --> 01:17:05.252
Hey. Clear.


01:17:08.359 --> 01:17:10.759
<i>Sing something else.
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:10.928 --> 01:17:12.225
Like what?


01:17:12.496 --> 01:17:14.361
The demo you snuck my dad. I heard it.


01:17:14.531 --> 01:17:16.328
Yeah, do it!
Do it!


01:17:16.500 --> 01:17:21.870
<i>We want more!
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:24.641 --> 01:17:26.609
Okay, follow my lead, guys.


01:17:34.318 --> 01:17:38.311
<i>There's a little secret
I would like to tell you</i>


01:17:41.425 --> 01:17:46.055
<i>There's a book of lies
I know they'll try to sell you</i>


01:17:47.297 --> 01:17:50.858
<i>And they'll try and they'll try
To convince you to buy</i>


01:17:51.035 --> 01:17:52.525
<i>You need them</i>


01:17:54.505 --> 01:17:57.941
<i>So the next time you're down
Look inside, not around</i>


01:17:58.108 --> 01:18:01.271
<i>I can dress myself</i>


01:18:01.445 --> 01:18:04.380
<i>There's no need for someone's help</i>


01:18:04.548 --> 01:18:06.175
<i>There's no one to blame</i>


01:18:06.350 --> 01:18:12.084
<i>There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:18:12.256 --> 01:18:15.555
<i>I can justify</i>


01:18:15.726 --> 01:18:18.695
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:18:18.862 --> 01:18:22.059
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:18:22.232 --> 01:18:24.632
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:18:24.802 --> 01:18:27.930
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:18:29.406 --> 01:18:36.278
<i>Do you ever wonder
How anything can make you cry?</i>


01:18:36.447 --> 01:18:40.110
<i>Have yourself discover</i>


01:18:40.284 --> 01:18:47.281
<i>That the pain you feel
Is the pain that you deny</i>


01:18:47.458 --> 01:18:50.723
<i>You can bless yourself</i>


01:18:50.894 --> 01:18:53.795
<i>There's no need for someone else</i>


01:18:53.964 --> 01:19:01.393
<i>There's no one to blame
There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:19:01.572 --> 01:19:04.769
<i>I can justify</i>


01:19:04.942 --> 01:19:07.911
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:19:08.078 --> 01:19:11.172
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:19:11.348 --> 01:19:13.839
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:19:14.017 --> 01:19:16.747
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:19:34.271 --> 01:19:35.932
Thank you, ladies and gentlemen.


01:19:36.106 --> 01:19:39.507
