You're like a freaking rock star.


01:19:45.115 --> 01:19:47.208
Are you kidding me? Man, she likes you...


01:19:58.428 --> 01:20:01.363
So, what did he say? Is he mad?


01:20:01.532 --> 01:20:03.193
Yeah. He's pretty ticked off...


01:20:03.367 --> 01:20:07.133
...that I'm not already making
the next big album for Kensington Records.


01:20:09.106 --> 01:20:10.869
Oh. Which album?


01:20:11.775 --> 01:20:12.799
Your album.


01:20:14.478 --> 01:20:16.469
- Are you kidding me?
- No.


01:20:18.081 --> 01:20:20.549
- You're... You're serious?
- Uh-huh.


01:20:22.786 --> 01:20:24.117
Go for it.


01:20:24.288 --> 01:20:27.052
We're making an album.
And we're writing it together.


01:20:27.224 --> 01:20:29.283
Yeah! Yeah!
I'm so happy.


01:20:29.459 --> 01:20:31.256
You know, I sing too.


01:20:31.428 --> 01:20:35.057
I can do a whole monologue album.
Incredible. Hey, congratulations.


01:20:35.232 --> 01:20:39.760
- Yo, blow it up. Boom.
I'm your boy. Call me up.


01:20:39.937 --> 01:20:43.338
Yeah. Yeah, he's really good
at guitars. He's a kook.


01:20:58.055 --> 01:20:59.647
Guy! Wait!


01:20:59.823 --> 01:21:03.315
