01:21:19.676 --> 01:21:21.143
Guy!


01:21:22.479 --> 01:21:26.142
I will have my nirvana moment.


01:21:26.383 --> 01:21:30.149
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:21:31.622 --> 01:21:34.682
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:21:34.858 --> 01:21:37.452
Oh, come on. Look alive, people.
I'm a star.


01:21:37.628 --> 01:21:39.186
Let's try this again.


01:21:39.396 --> 01:21:41.261
<i>I'll make you believe...</i>


01:21:42.833 --> 01:21:45.563
Oh, no. You want a piece of me?


01:22:11.228 --> 01:22:13.458
Hey. Clear.


01:22:29.146 --> 01:22:31.307
<i>Run this town tonight</i>


01:22:31.481 --> 01:22:33.847
Where's breakfast...? Sorry.


01:23:15.726 --> 01:23:18.320
<i>I'm lost in a world
That rattles my brain</i>


01:23:18.495 --> 01:23:21.362
<i>I'm cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:23:26.336 --> 01:23:29.863
- Katie, are you wearing a doormat?
- Welcome.


01:23:36.313 --> 01:23:38.372
Thanks. Now the pants.


01:23:43.553 --> 01:23:47.853
And then it would just take you somewhere
that you never expected you would go.


01:23:52.295 --> 01:23:55.287
<i>You wanna hear
the monologue from My Fair Lady?</i>


01:23:55.465 --> 01:23:57.592
Oy, mate, oy.


01:24:17.087 --> 01:24:18.952
I love my life.


01:24:19.122 --> 01:24:21.317
<i>Call me.
- Hello?</i>


01:24:43.780 --> 01:24:46.977
<i>Yeah. You like it? You like it? Yeah.</i>

